{"game": "mass-effect-3", "language": "english", "appid": 1238020, "month": "2020-08", "window": 2, "start_date": 1596844800, "end_date": 1597535999, "month_true_total": 42, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 19:51:41 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "74361105", "author": {"steamid": "76561198035647204", "personaname": "Colbierto", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/colbierto/", "num_games_owned": 2238, "num_reviews": 68, "playtime_forever": 1384, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1383, "last_played": 1598331671, "avatar": "2cc9dd5a36da054dc8f40417b3b3be58d95bdc15"}, "language": "english", "review": "I bought this game 8 years late, with having loved the first two. I believe that I have some rose tinted glasses it turns out. This game simply does not hold up gameplay wise. Its a fairly minimalistic cover based shooter with (very) light RPG elements. The story fares better, with it being wholly enjoyable until the last few hours (as everyone knows at this point). I wouldn't say it was bad, just disappointing. Overall, the story and characters felt like a step back from the second game. This game felt like it was clearly meant to tie up the story (something that saga finales suffer from often), rather than drive it to its natural conclusion. If you insist of finishing the fight, pick it up. I cannot recommend it however, for any other reason at this point.", "timestamp_created": 1597514615, "timestamp_updated": 1597514615, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.47358742356300354", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "74358437", "author": {"steamid": "76561198118158882", "personaname": "Kaidan Alenko's stupid haircut", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_ur